From 8e7a3a96afb821b895136cb59390a9fbfebc3d05 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Vicory <dvicory@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 02:00:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(workspaces): make runtime identity stable end to end

Preserve resumed conversation workspace identity, pin spawned workers to their pre-spawn broker environment, and use one board-qualified task/run identity across control and execution requests.

These were three corrective patches over the same runtime identity contract; keeping them separate made later patches repeatedly rewrite the same gateway, worker-lane, and Gondolin adapter surfaces.
